Great. Since you're still setting up the new source, I found a supported SailPoint configuration that we can start with.

The Microsoft Entra Direct Connection connector supports User Filters to limit which accounts are aggregated. 

SailPoint Documentation

Step 1 — Configure the account filter
Navigate to:

Admin → Connections → Sources → Your Entra Source → Aggregation Settings → Filter Settings

In User Filters, try:

startswith(userPrincipalName,'aa.')
This assumes the aa. prefix is at the beginning of the Entra userPrincipalName, such as aa.john.paul@company.com.

If the prefix is instead in the Entra displayName, use:

startswith(displayName,'aa.')
Save the configuration and run an account aggregation.

